  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.22 Fee for Audits of Continuing Compliance Activities and Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.22 Fee for Audits of Continuing Compliance Activities and Records. The fee for an audit of continuing competence activities and records shall be $100, provided that if the licensee was notified in accordance with Plc 308.04(b) of the requirement to use an on-line system to maintain continuing competence activities and records and is in compliance with that requirement, no fee shall be charged.\n\nSource. #14289, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
